WEBVTT

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:04.480
After breaking out of the underground facility, 
Shinji and his allies started a riot.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.370
City was plunged into chaos, 
while Jack dueled Sergey.

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:16.060
Sergey merged with his D-Wheel, 
becoming a true racing duel machine.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.540
He forced Jack up against the wall.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.650
But at the very end, Jack came 
from behind to win.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.560
D-Wheels.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.840
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.440
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.890
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.100
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:21.950
The Duel You Believe In

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:25.200
The winner is Jack Atlas!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.930
Sergey had him at the end of his rope, 
but he turned it around for victory.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:33.630
That is how the king entertains!

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:38.570
When he lost, Sergey fell off 
the highway course...

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:40.070
I wonder if he's okay.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.490
Can he still move?

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:53.630
He's the evil criminal, once known 
as the Duelist Crusher.

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.420
If he revives and starts going nuts again...

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.720
Either way, he's a Tops dog!

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.760
Let's finish him off, right now!

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.430
Revive! Revive right now, Sergey.

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:07.720
You are invincible.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.270
Invincible!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:10.860
No.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:15.320
That cannot be...

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:20.860
Sergey was my trump card...

00:03:21.350 --> 00:03:24.650
This was my dream!

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:26.780
Curse you...

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:28.750
Curse you all...

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.720
Tops requesting aid in region AA01.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:37.470
It seems a large number of Tops have 
been left behind in region AB03.

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:41.430
The rioting Commons have reached the Tops 
residential zone, impeding evacuation.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:45.450
They're asking us to get rid of the 
Commons as soon as possible!

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.340
Get rid of them?

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:50.640
Very well...

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:56.110
Attention, all security personnel 
deployed throughout City.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:02.850
You must use everything you have 
to suppress the Commons' riot.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.870
By any means necessary.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.240
They're finally rolling out.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.640
We knew it would come to this.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:26.970
Unless we take out security,

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:29.980
we'll never overturn the Tops' world.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:33.320
I summon Alien Shocktrooper!

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:38.200
I summon Plaguespreader Zombie!

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:44.310
I summon Battlewasp — Arbalest the Rapidfire!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:47.980
Let's go!

00:04:48.580 --> 00:04:51.070
Time to get our revenge!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:56.410
We'll show you the anger of the Commons, 
oppressed for all these years!

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:06.120
Security's crackdown has begun.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:09.960
And the Commons are resisting by force, too!

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.290
At this rate, war will break out in City.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.400
This way... Hurry!

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.130
What a mess this is.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:23.240
It's not gonna be easy to get up there.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.400
Brother...

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:29.000
Brother... Brother...

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.010
I'll open the way.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:37.370
While I draw their attention 
with my enjoy duel, you—

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:39.240
That isn't going to work.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.200
In this situation, no one wants to enjoy anything!

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:43.280
Shut up.

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:47.230
When I make a decision, I go. 
That is the road a man must walk!

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:51.910
Stay back...

00:05:58.400 --> 00:05:59.300
Stay back.

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.750
If you come, I'll...

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:12.620
I'll beat you all!

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:13.370
Layra—

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.120
Hey! Not you, too!

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:22.960
Kurosaki!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.630
Calm down. This is not your battlefield.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:32.710
Attention, all residents of City.

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.610
I, director of the Public Order Bureau,

00:06:36.150 --> 00:06:37.880
Jean-Michel Roget,

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:43.010
in response to the rioting 
by Commons in all areas,

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:48.380
and as an answer to the many Tops' 
requests to restore order in City,

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:51.690
hereby declare martial law.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.160
Martial law?

00:06:54.560 --> 00:06:59.120
As of this moment, all laws are suspended,

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:05.140
and judicial and executive power falls to me.

00:07:05.430 --> 00:07:08.400
So he's finally resorting to brute force.

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.110
Martial law? Absurd.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:15.720
He probably thought the people 
would bow to his will

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:19.770
if his lackey Sergey beat Jack.

00:07:19.770 --> 00:07:22.510
But then he lost...

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.090
Right, chairman?

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.500
Yes, it was a great miscalculation on his part.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:32.620
Now, with this move by Roget, 
what will you do?

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:36.770
Don't be fooled!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.650
Roget isn't trying to restore order.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.680
He wants Tops and Commons to fight,

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.150
so he can take control of City by force!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.350
You cannot let this happen!

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:51.510
Yuzu!

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:54.790
This is no time to be fighting amongst ourselves.

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:59.020
Tops and Commons need to stop 
fighting and unite right now!

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:02.260
Academia is after the Synchro Dimension, too!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.730
To protect your home, you all 
need to work together!

00:08:07.800 --> 00:08:11.170
Yuya, if you can hear me, do as I say.

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.200
Stop the fighting.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:17.280
Make everyone smile with the entertainment 
duels we learned at You Show—

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:18.120
Stop it!

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.020
Yuzu!

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.000
Wait, Yuya!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.010
Don't stop me!

00:08:24.010 --> 00:08:26.060
I need to save Yuzu, fast!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.050
Is that what Yuzu would want?

00:08:28.390 --> 00:08:30.680
I don't care! Yuzu's out there!

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:32.760
You want me to just abandon her?

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:36.290
Sora and Tsukikage will save her!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:38.790
Trust your allies, Yuya.

00:08:39.720 --> 00:08:41.100
As Yuzu said,

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:44.570
our priority now should be stopping the riots.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:46.600
Yuya!

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.740
I finally found you...

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.990
Sam, what are you doing here?

00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:57.200
I was looking for you!

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:58.720
Jack asked me to.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:08:59.920
Jack?

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:04.390
Yes. He had a message he had to give to you.

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:07.760
I was disappointed in Yuya Sakaki's 
semifinal performance.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:13.850
In his duel with Crow, all I felt was a drive 
to force others to bend to his will.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:19.050
If that's the kind of duel he strives for, 
I have no need to fight him!

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:21.860
No need to fight me?!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.010
My duel with Crow... I barely remember it.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:35.780
All I remember is the sensation of 
wanting to wield great power...

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:39.610
It doesn't matter right now!

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.130
Why did Jack say that?

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:45.320
The situation has changed! 
Don't worry about it!

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:48.860
Jack said to tell you that, no matter what.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:50.600
He said that was my role.

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:52.100
Role?

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:58.570
Jack told me that if that isn't the 
kind of duel you're striving for...

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.350
Then prove it with a duel!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:05.400
Show me the true duel that 
Yuya Sakaki believes in.

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:09.290
If you're trying to accomplish something,

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:10.600
do not falter!

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:15.960
I... The duels I believe in, with all my heart...

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:21.480
The duels we learned at You Show 
School don't exist to hurt people.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.230
Entertainment duels...

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:26.070
...bring people joy and smiles.

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:27.870
Smiles?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:31.980
Jack's duel also excited everyone, 
and made them smile.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.880
Could it be that Jack...

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:36.810
Yuya?

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.080
Yuya, where are you going?

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:41.050
I'm going to the Duel Palace!

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:42.820
The Duel Palace?

00:10:44.340 --> 00:10:46.340
Jack's waiting there.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:49.230
To use our entertainment duel to save City!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.240
Yuzu fought...

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:55.640
Although she was captured, she worked 
hard to entrust me with her feelings.

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.360
Now it's my turn to fight!

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:03.550
Where are you going?

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.380
Wait!

00:11:04.820 --> 00:11:08.110
This building is surrounded by security!

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:13.440
Roget has declared martial law and 
invoked the power of the state.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.910
At a time like this, will you abandon us?

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:23.460
He's effectively conceding victory 
to Roget. Right, chairman?

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:26.960
Let's find out.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.550
We finally made it...

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:49.740
Yeah, thanks to the fabulous teamwork 
between me and Kurosaki.

00:11:49.740 --> 00:11:51.160
We're almost there.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:52.760
You'll see your brother soon.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:55.290
Brother... Brother...

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:58.930
But the last hurdle still awaits.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.330
Breaking through all that won't be easy.

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.940
I'll have to go, after all.

00:12:06.940 --> 00:12:10.040
While I distract them with my enjoy duel,

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.640
take Layra into the building!

00:12:12.640 --> 00:12:16.610
How many times must I tell you? 
That won't work!

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:17.900
Enjoy!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.680
I activate the effect of Kali Yuga.

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.090
I use one Overlay Unit

00:12:23.520 --> 00:12:27.120
to destroy all spell and trap cards on the field.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:37.000
Brother!

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.970
Brother... Brother!

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.670
Brother!

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:48.460
Don't let Reiji Akaba... escape.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.130
Arrest him.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.220
Stand back.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.940
Even if security is acting under martial law...

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:10.040
...you are not allowed to directly interfere...

00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:12.080
...with the Administrative Council.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.560
Right, chairman?

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.790
Certainly not.

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:19.430
After all, we are the absolute authority in City.

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.680
Absolute authority?

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:26.760
Certainly, you have great power of state.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:33.160
But if you only use it to protect yourselves, 
it means nothing, don't you think?

00:13:33.640 --> 00:13:36.360
This is what we have always done.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:39.730
If we are safe, then City is safe.

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:44.080
Under this system, everything has 
gone well so far.

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.700
Right, chairman?

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:46.680
Yes.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:49.050
That's right. We are society's counterweight.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.680
It is best that we not act recklessly.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:56.680
But now you have descended from your cloud

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.150
to come after me.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.210
Is it because you are afraid I will 
abandon this dimension?

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:07.160
In other words, you fear that the status quo—

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:11.600
where you make Roget and me fight, 
while you observe from a lofty perch—

00:14:11.600 --> 00:14:14.630
will be overturned, correct?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.340
Until now, that has worked for you...

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:21.240
You go with the winner, and things remain stable.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:24.830
But the invasion of Academia 
has changed everything.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.180
This is your world.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.900
An outsider like me has no right to speak.

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:36.490
But there is one thing I can say for sure.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:40.520
Those who sit on the sidelines have 
no right to speak about the future!

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:49.450
Damn! At this rate, how long will it 
take us to reach the Duel Palace?

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.170
Isn't there any other way?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.540
This is the fastest way to the Duel Palace.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:59.000
Frank... Amanda! Tanner!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.410
You're safe?

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:03.450
Of course we are.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:09.100
Crow raised us to know that you've gotta 
survive and not give up, no matter what.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:11.160
So we won't fall apart easily.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:14.130
Crow... Isn't he with you?

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:19.530
We decided to split up to look 
for Yuya, Sora, and Serena...

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.900
By now, maybe he's with Serena.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:22.870
No...

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:26.840
Serena's already been sent to Academia.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.060
Oh, no!

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:32.280
We, the Lancers, will surely save Serena.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:35.070
But first, stopping this riot should be—

00:15:35.070 --> 00:15:37.550
There's no way to stop it.

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.690
It's like this all over City!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.790
No one will listen to us.

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.760
That's why we must get to the Duel Palace!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.960
Why the Duel Palace?

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:49.380
Jack is waiting for me there.

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:53.160
So we can save City with the entertainment 
duel we put our faith in!

00:15:53.910 --> 00:15:55.290
You really believe that?

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.440
Then you'd better hurry.

00:15:57.440 --> 00:16:01.230
We know City's back roads 
like the backs of our hands.

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.070
Follow us!

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.750
Hey, Tanner!

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:05.640
Let's go.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.320
Thanks, everyone!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:11.150
You can thank us after you save City!

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.790
And after you beat Jack, of course.

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:16.590
I'm sure that's what Crow would say, too!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:26.650
Damon!

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:27.530
Are you okay?

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.960
We won't let it end here!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.400
The revolution's only started.

00:16:34.400 --> 00:16:35.740
We won't give up.

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:38.370
But at this rate...

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.710
Spread your ebony wings,

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:44.720
and strike the ground with the speed of lightning!

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.430
Synchro Summon!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:50.780
Rain down, Assault Blackwing — 
Raikiri the Rain Shower!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:53.150
Crow!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.680
We'll talk later.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:57.510
I activate Raikiri's effect!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.520
You saved us, Crow!

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.640
Yeah, thanks for coming!

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:16.430
If we fight together like this,

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:19.020
we can surely see our revolution through!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.730
Don't be stupid!

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.490
Didn't you see Yuzu on TV?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:29.040
Right now, this isn't the time to 
talk about Tops and Commons.

00:17:29.040 --> 00:17:32.540
We all need to work together 
and protect our city,

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:36.430
our children's futures, from Academia!

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:40.290
We can do that after we overthrow the Tops!

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:42.620
We won't forget what we owe them.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:46.120
I won't be satisfied until I repay them.

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.440
You can't expect us to say, "Oh, okay,"

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:51.450
and shake their hands, 
without any recompense!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:56.010
And while we talk about that, 
if the city we were born in...

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:59.360
this country, this world... is destroyed, then what?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:05.160
We need to prioritize destroying 
the Tops before Academia.

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:08.320
If you aren't with us in that fight...

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:10.030
Then you're against us!

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.370
Sorry, Crow, but if necessary, we'll see 
our revolution through by force.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.840
See? We're here.

00:18:21.840 --> 00:18:25.000
Then, if you just go down this road...

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.280
...you'll be at the Duel Palace!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:33.080
Give us the Tops that retreated 
into the Duel Palace!

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:37.790
Stop cowering in there, protected by security!

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:39.930
You cowards!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.660
Stop it! This isn't the time for that!

00:18:43.660 --> 00:18:45.800
Stop fighting and let us through!

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:49.410
We have business at the Duel Palace!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:53.610
Hey, someone's still trying to retreat in there!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:54.600
Get them!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:57.380
Anyone heading for the Duel Palace is our enemy!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:04.040
Then I, the man Gongenzaka, will put 
my life on the line to protect Yuya.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.060
No matter what happens to me,

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:10.360
I will see you through to the Duel Palace, Yuya!

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:11.330
Gongenzaka...

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:13.530
That's...

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:17.750
Kurosaki!

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:18.700
Yuya!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.900
Get on!

00:19:28.590 --> 00:19:30.360
Cool!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.450
Kurosaki, how did you know we were here?

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.430
After what Yuzu Hiiragi said,

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:42.930
he knew you'd head for the Duel Palace.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:44.500
Reiji?

00:19:56.160 --> 00:19:58.610
What? What's going on here?

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:04.650
Hey, everyone!

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:06.430
Start the cameras rolling.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:08.990
I have a feeling this is gonna get interesting.

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:10.220
Let's go!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:15.630
Yuya Sakaki just appeared, riding a monster!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.860
In this situation, what could he be planning?

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:22.350
Are they going to fight the Friendship Cup's final—

00:20:22.350 --> 00:20:24.220
I'm borrowing this.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:26.000
Hey, what are you doing?

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:30.470
Sorry, but I think he has something 
he wants to say.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.870
Take it, Yuya!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.390
Hey!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:39.180
The camera is rolling!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.660
Everyone, listen to me.

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:48.360
Tops and Commons...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:53.530
For now, I'd like you to stop the fighting, 
and listen to what I have to say.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.280
Yuya?

00:20:57.750 --> 00:21:02.310
Jack Atlas and I are about to duel in 
the finals of the Friendship Cup.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:06.620
I shall not allow you to act out 
during my martial law!

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.380
The finals are canceled!

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:13.210
I thought I already rescinded your authority.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:18.170
Thus, we, the Administrative Council, 
believe it is your martial law that is canceled.

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:19.860
Understand?

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:22.440
You old fools...

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:27.560
Even after everything, you want to oppose 
me and assert your authority?

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:34.180
Yuzu must be...

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.860
...here, in the Public Order Bureau.

00:21:40.550 --> 00:21:43.180
I want to show you all.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:45.650
Duels aren't tools of war.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:48.120
Duels exist to make people happy,

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.060
to make people smile.

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:55.560
I'm going to use this duel to prove that to you!

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:52.140
I'm going to duel Jack Atlas now.

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:54.380
But duels aren't tools of war.

00:23:54.920 --> 00:23:57.550
Duels exist to make people happy.

00:23:57.550 --> 00:23:59.020
How dare you?

00:23:59.380 --> 00:24:04.860
Round up everyone participating in the 
finals in defiance of my orders!

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:07.480
I won't allow anyone to interfere!

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:09.150
If you care about City's future,

00:24:09.150 --> 00:24:12.060
then watch this duel to the end!

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.890
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Borrowed Words.

00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:17.300
The fun is only getting started!
